# The newsroom desk. Both are required — without them every admin route
# answers 503 and the public paper carries on untouched.
#
# There is deliberately no default for either. A fallback in the source is a
# published password: this repository is public.
#
# Generate a session secret with:
#   openssl rand -base64 48
#
# Set them on Vercel with:
#   vercel env add ADMIN_PASSWORD production
#   vercel env add SESSION_SECRET production

# What an editor types to sign in. At least 12 characters.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=

# Signs the admin session cookie. At least 32 characters, random, and never
# the same string as ADMIN_PASSWORD.
SESSION_SECRET=
